        <mxCell id="limits" value="PILOT: safety ceilings≠capacity. Persistent store volumes have NO physical disk quota. Supervised≤30min/200requests/concurrency2; abort≥1GiB growth/&lt;10GiB free/unobservable. Stdout stays local, not re-ingested. No lossless/HA claim. Grafana UI bridge is non-internal; outbound traffic is possible, no egress enforcement. UI bridge authorized by direct human consent for local pilot only; Grafana Go soft384MiB/hard512MiB; HOST3300 VERIFIED." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="130" y="1210" width="1550" height="80" />
